<title>SPAIN: Dragados wins Madrid underground contract.</title>
<headline>Dragados wins Madrid underground contract.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish building company Dragados y Construcciones won a 6.7 billion peseta contract to build a new underground line in Madrid.</p>
<p>The statement added that the line should be completed in around 18 months.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
